      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i had surgery on my stomach last week (like 5 days ago) and im kinda worried. my belly is starting to hurt way more than it was yesterday and its feeling kinda hard/stiff when i press on it? i also have a little fever. is this normal for after surgery or should i be worried?",
